			"notes": "Initial release. [Please read the README file](https://github.com/jeffinitup/btw-presence-footsteps/blob/CE-3.0.0/README.md) for additional information on controls and how to modify and create your own PF resource packs.\n\n## Installation\n1. Add the latest version of the mod to your BTW instance's ``mods/`` folder\n2. Run the instance once, let it generate the ``presencefootsteps/`` directory in your ``mods/`` folder\n3. Download the resource archive and extract its contents into ``presencefootsteps/packs/``\n4. Reload your resources via ``CTRL+P`` or ``F3+S`` in order to hear PF in action!"
